# Serena MCP local state — regenerated per machine, not shared config.
# `memories/` is deliberately NOT here: those files are curated project
# knowledge (doctrine, tech stack, conventions, the task-completion checklist),
# so they are versioned and reviewed like any other doc. A fresh clone then has
# a Serena that already knows the project instead of re-onboarding.
/cache
/logs
/project.local.yml
